ng":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":6,"id":"code","children":[{"type":"text","value":"code"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"parts","children":[{"type":"text","value":"parts?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional parts?: boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L201","children":[{"type":"text","value":"format.ts:201"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Return individual key labels instead of a joined string. Default: false."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"platform","children":[{"type":"text","value":"platform?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional platform?: \"mac\" | \"windows\" | \"linux\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L197","children":[{"type":"text","value":"format.ts:197"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The target platform. Defaults to auto-detection."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"separatortoken","children":[{"type":"text","value":"separatorToken?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional separatorToken?: string | null;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L212","children":[{"type":"text","value":"format.ts:212"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Override the separator between display tokens. Defaults to platform-specific formatting when null/undefined."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"usesymbols","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useSymbols?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional useSymbols?: \n  | boolean\n  | {\n  keys?: boolean;\n  modifiers?: boolean;\n};","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L199","children":[{"type":"text","value":"format.ts:199"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Whether to use symbols for the display. Defaults to true."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"keylabels","text":"keyLabels?","level":3},{"id":"layoutmap","text":"layoutMap?","level":3},{"id":"get","text":"get","level":4},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":5},{"id":"code","text":"code","level":6},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"parts","text":"parts?","level":3},{"id":"platform","text":"platform?","level":3},{"id":"separatortoken","text":"separatorToken?","level":3},{"id":"usesymbols","text":"useSymbols?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [format.ts:195](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L195)\n\nOptions for formatting hotkeys for display.\n\n## Properties\n\n### keyLabels?\n\n```ts\noptional keyLabels?: Readonly<Record<string, string>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:210](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L210)\n\nFinal display overrides for logical keys or physical codes; take precedence over layoutMap. Never changes matching.\n\n***\n\n### layoutMap?\n\n```ts\noptional layoutMap?: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:208](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L208)\n\nAn already-resolved code-to-key map, such as KeyboardLayoutMap or Map.\nUsed only for physical bindings. Mapped keys receive normal display formatting;\nmissing or empty entries use conventional fallback labels. The caller owns\nloading and refreshing the map; this formatter never calls browser APIs.\n\n#### get\n\n```ts\nget: (code) => string | undefined;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### code\n\n`string`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`string` \\| `undefined`\n\n***\n\n### parts?\n\n```ts\noptional parts?: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:201](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L201)\n\nReturn individual key labels instead of a joined string. Default: false.\n\n***\n\n### platform?\n\n```ts\noptional platform?: \"mac\" | \"windows\" | \"linux\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:197](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L197)\n\nThe target platform. Defaults to auto-detection.\n\n***\n\n### separatorToken?\n\n```ts\noptional separatorToken?: string | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:212](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L212)\n\nOverride the separator between display tokens. Defaults to platform-specific formatting when null/undefined.\n\n***\n\n### useSymbols?\n\n```ts\noptional useSymbols?: \n  | boolean\n  | {\n  keys?: boolean;\n  modifiers?: boolean;\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:199](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L199)\n\nWhether to use symbols for the display. Defaults to true.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: FormatDisplayOptions\ntitle: FormatDisplayOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:195](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L195)\n\nOptions for formatting hotkeys for display.\n\n## Properties\n\n### keyLabels?\n\n```ts\noptional keyLabels?: Readonly<Record<string, string>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:210](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L210)\n\nFinal display overrides for logical keys or physical codes; take precedence over layoutMap. Never changes matching.\n\n***\n\n### layoutMap?\n\n```ts\noptional layoutMap?: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:208](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L208)\n\nAn already-resolved code-to-key map, such as KeyboardLayoutMap or Map.\nUsed only for physical bindings. Mapped keys receive normal display formatting;\nmissing or empty entries use conventional fallback labels. The caller owns\nloading and refreshing the map; this formatter never calls browser APIs.\n\n#### get\n\n```ts\nget: (code) => string | undefined;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### code\n\n`string`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`string` \\| `undefined`\n\n***\n\n### parts?\n\n```ts\noptional parts?: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:201](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L201)\n\nReturn individual key labels instead of a joined string. Default: false.\n\n***\n\n### platform?\n\n```ts\noptional platform?: \"mac\" | \"windows\" | \"linux\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:197](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L197)\n\nThe target platform. Defaults to auto-detection.\n\n***\n\n### separatorToken?\n\n```ts\noptional separatorToken?: string | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:212](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L212)\n\nOverride the separator between display tokens. Defaults to platform-specific formatting when null/undefined.\n\n***\n\n### useSymbols?\n\n```ts\noptional useSymbols?: \n  | boolean\n  | {\n  keys?: boolean;\n  modifiers?: boolean;\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [format.ts:199](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/format.ts#L199)\n\nWhether to use symbols for the display. Defaults to true.\n"}
